  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Country Research Ideas: LAS25KM10O</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This includes a validation for the potential establishment of a cross-border land governance Master of Science (MSc) program, involving LAS countries within the Middle Eastern and Northern Africa (MENA) region. The study will map out existing academic initiatives and land governance cooperation initiatives, identify possible added value, and explore how such a program could be developed.</narrative>
  </description>
